<title>ITALY: Italian news car registration surge in June.</title>
<headline>Italian news car registration surge in June.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations soared 50.71 percent in June to 222,800 units, Italian Transport Minister Claudio Burlando said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Burlando told reporters that registrations in the first half of 1997 were 31.32 percent higher at 1,312,400 units.</p>
